{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/115263","id":3199314325,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6-samV","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115263","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115263.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115263.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115263","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/115263/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/115263/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115263/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/fe8e46b2e7ccbae6e6aedebb5ea7db1799ec1f76","number":115263,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"GLTF Physics material export & import","user":{"login":"elix22","id":7060531,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcwNjA1MzE=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7060531?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/elix22","html_url":"https://github.com/elix22","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elix22/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elix22/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elix22/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elix22/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elix22/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elix22/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elix22/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elix22/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elix22/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"\r\n\r\n## Changes:\r\n- Added `GLTFPhysicsMaterial` class to handle physics material conversion between Godot and glTF\r